          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu kwibanza lya ng'wa Pilato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lyūbūūka pyī ī libita kūntwala ū Yesu kūlī Pilato, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "būūkandya kūmūūla balīhaya gīkī, “Ū ng'wing'wana ng'wenūyū twamonile akūlīhūbyaga ī lihanga lise; hangī nīyo akūbalemejaga a banhū nū kūtoba ī goodi ya ng'wa Kaisali, akwigīmbaga gīkī ū wei Kilisito, angū nang'hwe ntemi ī gīko!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Pilato ūmūja gīkī, “Angū ū bebe hū ūlī ntemi wa Bayudaya?” Ūnshokeja ūng'wīla, “Bebe h'ūyo wahaya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Pilato ūbawīla a bagabīji bataale nī libita lya banhū gīkī, “Ū nene natūbonaga būbi ū mulī munhū ng'wenūyū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo bongeja kūhaya gīkī, “Akūjaga ūlanga mihayo ya kūyuuga masala ga banhū hose pye ū mu Būyudaya; nīyo wandīgije Galilaya. Ī haha ūūyū washikaga nū kūūnū!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu kū būtongi bo ng'wa Helode",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Pilato aho wigwa gīko ūbūja, amane ūlū gīkī ū munhū ng'wenūyo walī muna Galilaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wamana gīkī walī afumile kū būsugi bo ng'wa Helode, ūntūma ū kūlī Helode, ūyo nang'hwe akasangwa alī mu Yelusalemu ī shikū jenījo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Helode akayega no ū kūmona ū Yesu, nguno walī na shikū ningī akūlwigwaga ū lūkumo lokwe; nose walī na ng'hūmbū ja kūmona alībeeja mihayo ya kūkumya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna wandya kūmūgīlīja mihayo mingī; alīyo ū Yesu atanshokegije nūūlū hado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bīmīīla a bagabīji bataale na a balangi ba shilagīlo būteegana kūmūūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Helode nanhgwe na a bashilikale bakwe, būyūngīmba nyachilū ū Yesu. Būngumīīla līng'wenda ly'ikūjo, hūna ūnshosha kūlī Pilato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūfuma lūshikū lwenūlo ū Helode nū Pilato būnwana, nguno ī kwandya baalī na wanishi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ūlamulwa nsango gwa kūbūlagwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Pilato ūbitana a bagabīji bataale na a basugi, na a banhū pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla gīkī, “Ng'wanenhelaga ū munhū ng'wenūyū, gīkī akūhūbyaga banhū; alīyo angū namūja ning'we ng'wabona, gīkī atī na būbi ū mu mihayo īyo mulīmūūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo pyī nū Helode atabonile būbi bose bose, nguno watūshokeja hangī bise; hū kūhaya īlī hape gīkī atīnīīta mhayo ūyo gwigeleelilwe nsango gwa kūbūlagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū nahene, lekī nang'hūgūle bo mbooko, nanekele aje!” [ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lya shigukulu yalī īng'wigeleelile kūbataligūlīla munhū ūmò.] ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike pyī ī libita lya banhū lyūhoolanīja n'ilaka lya higūlya līlīhaya gīkī, “Ng'wīnjage ū ng'wenūyū, ūtūtaligūlīle Balaba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Balaba ūyo wahayiagwa walī watungwa kūlwa kwenheleja nsambo nebe mu nzengo, na kūlwa būbūlagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Pilato ūbawīla hangī a banhū, gīkī walī na ng'hūmbū ja kūntaligūlīla ū Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo būhoolanīja balīhaya, “Nkomage ha nsalaba, nkomage ha nsalaba ū ng'wenūyo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla hangī lūkangala lo kadatū gīkī, “Ī gete wītile būbi kī ū munhū ng'wenūyū? Ū nene natūgūbonaga ū mhayo ūyo gūshikile kūng'wenheleja kūcha; na lūūlū leki nang'hūgūle bo kūntūla nanekele!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo bongeja kūhamuka n'ilaka lya higūlya, gīkī akong'we ha nsalaba; nose a malaka gabo gūtinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana ū Pilato ūlamula gīkī gwītwe ūyo bagūlombaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbataligūlīla ū munhū ūyo bakang'wigongela, ūyo olī otungwa kūlwa nsambo na būbūlagi; ūmfunya ū Yesu gīt'ūmo boolī ū ūtogwa wabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu kūkong'wa ha nsalaba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balīntwala bakamanhya na munhū ūmò, Simoni muna Kilene, wizaga mu nzengo kūfuma kū ngūnda, būnseseja ū nsalaba, hūna ūja alīshimīza a ha numa ya ng'wa Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ibita itaale lya banhū lyankūūbījaga; baalīmo na bakīma bajaga balīlīla ng'hūngū, bakūnīlaga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yesu akīīta ūbagalūkīla ūbawīla gīkī, “Bing'we bashīke ba Yelusalemu mutanilīlage ū nene, ilīlagi bing'we benekīlī na baana bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno jikūshika shikū bakūyūhaya gīkī, ‘Balī na lubango a bagūmba, nī nda ījo jitabūūkije baana, pyī nī mbeele ījo jitong'hilwe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma bakūyūjiwīla ngūlū gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūlū balīgima kūgwītīla mihayo īlī gīkī ū ntī aho gūtaalī ndoto, alīyo ūlū gūlinda gūūma, īkūbiza ginehe lūūlū ahene!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na basambo babīlī bakatwalwa kūjūbūlagwa hamò nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bashika h'ipandī līkitanagwa lūpaanga, būnkoma ha nsalaba hamò na a basambo benabo; būlī ng'wene ha nsalaba gokwe, ūmò kū būlyo, ūngī kū lūmoso! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yesu ūhaya gīkī, “Baba balekejage, nguno batūgūmanaga ūyo balīgwīta.” Ī likanza lyenīlo bandya kūshigabanha ī shizwalo shakwe bo kūshesela mbale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū bīmīīla kwiloleela, alīyo a basugi bandya kūyūneeneleja mu būdalahi balīhaya, “Tūhaya ū ng'wenūyū walikalaga ūpīja bangī shi, ni ipījage lūūlū nū wei ng'wenekīlī ūlū ng'hana Kilisito, nsolwa wa ng'wa Mulungu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bashilikale nabo būng'wegeela bandya kūngīmba nyachilū, būng'winha siki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kūnū balīhaya gīkī, “Al'ipījage ūlū ūlī ntemi wa Bayudaya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A higūlya yakwe a ha nsalaba boolīho wandīke būhayile gīkī, “Ūyū ntemi o Bayudaya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūhayimanīla, ūmò wa babo baalī bakong'wa ha nsalaba hamò nang'hwe, wang'wīla ū Yesu gīkī, “Tūhaya ūlī Kilisito ahene ū bebe? Ali k'ipījage shi lūūlū, na a bise ūtūpīje!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wiye ūng'hama; ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ū bebe ūtūng'ogohaga na Mulungu shi? Angū ūlībona gīkī na a bise tūlī mu nsango hū gūmò dūhū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo hangī a bise tūlanukūla mu ng'hana gīt'ūmo shītīle shise shalī; lelo ū munhū ng'wenūyū atīītile nūūlū mhayo gūmò gwa būbi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūhaya, “Yesu ūlanizūkwe nane ū mu būtemi wako ūlū washoka!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūng'wīla, “Zunyaga nalīkūwīla gwa ng'hana gīkī, ī lelo īyī ūkūbiza hamò nane mu paladiso.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūcha kwa ng'wa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yashika gītī sa itandatū shūbiza ho giiti, shīkundīkīja pyī ī sī, kūshisha sa kenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī līīmi lyoya ū kwaaka, nī lisenge lya mu hekalu lyūtandūka ha gatī na ha gatī lyūlekana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūlīla n'ilaka itaale ūhaya, “Baba nagūtūūla mu makono gako ū moyo gwane!” Aho wamala kūhaya gīko ūzumalīka! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale wa bashilikale igana aho wabona ūmo īkajīla, ūnkumīlīja Mulungu alīhaya gīkī, “Bing'we ū munhū ng'wenūyū ng'hana walī ntūngīlīja!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye abo baalī biza kwiloleela aho balīshoka būlī ng'wene waja alitūla tūla ha shikuba kūlwa būpīna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo pye abo baalī baamanile, na a bakīma abo baalī banondeela kūfuma Galilaya, bayiloleelaga ī mihayo yenīyī bīmīīlaga ka kūle ho hado.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūjīkwa kwa ng'wa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho ūmò wa banamhala b'ibanza; munhū ntūngīlīja, hangī wawiza. Witanagwa Yosefu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muna Alimataya; nzengo gūmò gwaho gwa mu mizengo ya Būyudaya. Ū wei walī atizunīlīgije nalyo ī libanza ū mu būlamuji walyo; nīyo nang'hwe walī abūlindīīlile ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūja ū kūlī Pilato ūūkagūlomba ū mīlī gwa ng'wa Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wagwicha ūgūlingīīla ng'wenda gwawiza ūgūlaaja mu shigila shipya shalī shisīmbilwe ng'wiwe gīt'ihalo. Gwalī gūtaalī kūlaajiwa mo mīlī nūūlū gūmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūlo lwalī lwa kūlonja lonja kūlwa sabato; nīyo nayo yūsangwa yegeela kūshika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bakīma abo baalī biza nang'hwe kūfuma Galilaya bakakūūbīja, būūkashibona ī shigila, nū mumo gūkalaagījiwa ū mīlī gokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būshoka kūjūlonja lonja būgota bo ng'waso nsoga na maguta. Alīyo a ha sabato bifuula, gīt'ūmo shilagīlo shihayīlile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
